// The Last Harvest: the survival map for four defenders. An autumn heartland
// in the middle, the defenders' starts above the beaches of the south sea, a
// broad valley north to the Progenitor's base, which stands at grade at its
// head (no rampart, no ramps). Round the heartland, each region in its own
// climate: the desert's mesas and canyon passes to the north-west, alpine
// basins under snow to the north-east, a tropical archipelago to the
// south-west, polar fjords to the south-east, the south sea joining the two
// seas behind the defenders. Shaper sites in every region and in the base,
// the auxiliary Shapers hidden behind them.
// Positions are metres, x east, y north, from the south-west corner. They
// match crates/mc-map/src/bake/harvest.rs (its `harvest_block` test prints
// the facility block and the sites); the walls are
// mc_map::landmark::HARVEST_WALLS. crates/mc-map/tests/last_harvest.rs holds
// them to the baked terrain.
(
    biome: Autumn,
    time: Dusk,
    // The regions merge into one another over half a kilometre either side of a
    // wall, along a line wandering a kilometre or so off it; the walls are not lit.
    blend: 500,
    regions: [
        (name: "Heartland", climate: Autumn, weather: Fair, tweaks: (mist: 0.6, rain: 0.2)),
        (name: "Desert", climate: Desert, weather: Clear, tweaks: (rain: 0.0, wind: 9)),
        (name: "Alpine", climate: Temperate, weather: Cloudy, tweaks: (rain: 0.6)),
        (name: "Isles", climate: Tropical, weather: Cloudy, tweaks: (rain: 0.4)),
        (name: "Fjords", climate: Polar, weather: Cloudy, tweaks: (rain: 0.6, wind: 16)),
    ],
    walls: [
        (line: [(8600, 24900), (8400, 21800), (8900, 18600), (8900, 15400), (7900, 12500), (6400, 11200)], left: 0, right: 1),
